  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Vapor (Continued)** (1 review): Vapor runs on into a second part, which this listener tracks separately [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2004-11-19-04flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 68 min; rated 4.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer expects good sound because the venue has a strong sound system, but had not yet downloaded it; Reviewer says the horns come across well on the recording [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Crowd-noise tracks sit between Aladdin and El Ron, and again between El Ron and Vapor [2]\n- Band introductions fall between One in Seven and the closing Cannonball [2]\n- Attendee says most of the crowd came for MMW and knew little about Soulive [4]\n- Early on people were still wandering in; by the set's end the whole room was shaking [4]\n- Attendee felt sorry for MMW, who had to follow Soulive's set [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2004-11-19-04flac16**: taped by mrsoul; transferred by mrsoul; source: AT822>Sony NH900 Hi-MD (PCM) [1]",
